## 🧯 Common Issues & Fixes

| Problem | Fix |
|---|---|
| `BenchmarkDotNet requires Release mode` error | Always use `dotnet run -c Release` |
| `FileNotFoundException` for PDFs in benchmark | Confirm `wwwroot/Malfuzat/` has all 8 volumes |
| `dotnet run` fails — port in use | `dotnet run --urls "http://localhost:5050"` |
| Benchmark hot-path times nearly equal | Normal on 2-core machine — highlight the **cold-start** row instead |
| `IMemoryCache` not registered error on UI | Make sure `AddMemoryCache()` is in `Program.cs` |
| `_env` is null / NullReferenceException | Confirm the DI constructor is in place and the old parameterless ctor is removed |

