> 💡 **Pro tip:** Start the **baseline benchmarks in Step 2c early** — they run in the background while you code. By the time you finish the refactor (~40 min of coding), the v1 results are already waiting. Then trigger the v2 run immediately after `dotnet build`, and they'll finish while you walk through the architecture. The audience never sees you waiting for benchmarks.

